# AquaSDG v2 - Environment Variables
# Add these in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables

# ─── Optional: Enhanced AI Features ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Gemini API Key (enables AI policy brief generation)
# Get one at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ─── Optional: Enhanced Satellite Data ────────────────────────────────────────
# GCP Service Account Key (enables Google Earth Engine satellite imagery)
# Without this, app falls back to JRC Global Surface Water static data
GCP_PROJECT_ID=
GCP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY=

# ─── No Auth Required (free public APIs used by default) ──────────────────────
# These data sources require NO keys - they work out of the box:
# • World Bank Open Data - country water/sanitation indicators
# • Open-Meteo - historical precipitation & climate trends
# • UN ReliefWeb / GDACS - flood event history
# • OpenStreetMap Overpass - water infrastructure counts
# • JRC Global Surface Water - surface water extent changes
# • WRI Aqueduct - water stress indices
# • INFORM Risk Index - vulnerability scores
